#. Description of the plugin
#: event-toolkit-for-custom-fields.php
msgid "Spreads the events you keep in custom fields (ACF, ACPT or plain post meta): add-to-calendar links and .ics files, a subscribable calendar feed, schema.org markup for search engines, a weekly preview for Telegram and an RSS feed for e-mail newsletters, Instagram stories and story images to share. Extra dynamic data fields for Breakdance and abilities for AI agents."
msgstr ""

#: event-toolkit-for-custom-fields.php:27
msgid "Event Toolkit for Custom Fields replaces the plugins \"Add to Calendar from Custom Fields\" and \"Event Digest for Telegram\". Please deactivate them; all settings are taken over."
msgstr ""

